  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRC Nyiragongo eruption 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nyiragongo started erupting on 22nd May 2021 early evening: two lava flows descended, one eastwards towards the border with Rwanda, and the other towards the south reaching the outskirts of Goma during the night. 15 people lost their lives and between 3,000 and 5,000 people are reported to have fled into Rwanda.
&#xa0;Experts have predicted that a new eruption is likely to occur in the coming days, so the authorities have ordered the evacuation of part of the city of Goma.</narrative>
  </description>
